# ============================================================
# Runtime uploads — mutable knowledge base written by POST /upload
# (see app/config.py UPLOAD_DIR, app/main.py, docs/architecture.md
# "Two knowledge bases, one logical corpus"). Never commit what a
# reviewer/recruiter uploads at runtime; data/corpus/ (the immutable
# six-document assignment corpus) is unaffected by this rule.
# ============================================================
data/uploads/*
!data/uploads/.gitkeep